{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-06-17 10:00:00', 'title': 'HII DEDICATES 19TH HABITAT FOR HUMANITY HOME', 'text': "NEWPORT NEWS, VA., JUNE 17, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- GLOBAL DEFENSE AND TECHNOLOGIES PARTNER HII (NYSE: HII) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY'S NEWPORT NEWS SHIPBUILDING DIVISION JOINED ELECTED OFFICIALS AND COMMUNITY LEADERS THURSDAY TO DEDICATE THE 19TH HOUSE SHIPYARD VOLUNTEERS HAVE CONSTRUCTED IN PARTNERSHIP WITH HABITAT FOR HUMANITY PENINSULA AND GREATER WILLIAMSBURG SINCE 2002."}